# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  External sources cloned outside the repo
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Cloned whisper.cpp upstream — external source, not versioned here.
# Used to rebuild Deckle.Transcription's native runtime (libwhisper.dll +
# ggml-*.dll) on demand ; binaries land in %LOCALAPPDATA%\Deckle\native\,
# never in the repo. Runtime model weights similarly live under
# %LOCALAPPDATA%\Deckle\models\, sourced by the first-run wizard.
whisper.cpp/

# Vendored upstream Rust source for the voxtral-burn POC — clone of
# TrevorS/voxtral-mini-realtime-rs landed inside the worktree for
# convenience, build artifacts and target/ stay local. Model weights
# live under D:\models\llm\voxtral\, never in the repo.
benchmark/rs/voxtral-mini-realtime-rs/

# Legacy doc revisions kept locally for reference — superseded versions
# of docs/*.md moved aside when a new revision lands. Not shipped.
docs/archives/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Build artifacts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# .NET build output.
src/**/bin/
src/**/obj/
tests/**/bin/
tests/**/obj/
benchmark/cs/**/bin/
benchmark/cs/**/obj/

# Deployment output — rebuildable via dotnet publish.
publish/

# Misc build logs.
build-log.txt
**/build.log
**/*.binlog
**/xamlcompiler.log
**/xaml.out

# MSBuild leftovers occasionally written outside bin/obj.
**/*.tlog
**/*.lastbuildstate
MSBuild_*.failure.txt

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  IDE / OS junk
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Visual Studio local state.
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.vsidx

# JetBrains, Vim swap, macOS, Windows Explorer thumbnails.
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# VSCode Local History extension.
.history/

# Backup / patch / merge leftovers.
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.rej
.~lock.*

# Aider AI session state — may contain private context.
.aider*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Secrets / credentials — preventive, no such file should ever exist here
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Environment variable files.
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
.envrc

# Private keys, certificates, secret stores.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.secret
*.secrets
secrets/
credentials*.json
credentials*.toml
credentials*.yaml
credentials*.yml
*.credential
auth.json
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
id_dsa*

# Cloud / container credentials.
.aws/
.gcloud/
.docker/config.json
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig

# Local config overrides — Microsoft / .NET conventions.
appsettings.local.json
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.development.json
local.settings.json
*.local.json

# Misplaced MCP config — preventive, these files may embed tokens.
.mcp.json
mcp.json

# Windows shortcuts (.lnk) and Internet Shortcuts (.url) — embed
# metadata that fingerprints the host (LocalBasePath, MachineID, user
# SID via target). Keep them off the repo even if their target is
# benign. Convenience links to %LocalAppData%\Deckle\, the auto-memory
# directory, etc., live next to the working tree but stay local.
*.lnk
*.url

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Runtime artifacts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Crash dumps and ad hoc diagnostic files.
.tmp/
**/.tmp-*
*.dmp
*.mdmp
crash-*.log
crashdumps/

# Ad hoc DebugLog folder used for native crash instrumentation —
# temporary by doctrine, never committed (see Deckle.Logging/CLAUDE.md).
/logs/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Benchmark — runtime artifacts, never versioned
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#   telemetry/  raw Deckle capture (corpus JSONL + WAVs, latency, app log).
#               Layout: <slug>/corpus.jsonl, <slug>/audio/*.wav, …
#   reports/    per-run benchmark output (last_<name>_run.{json,txt},
#               per-experiment snapshots). Regenerated each run.
#   logs/       step-by-step log of the benchmark script itself —
#               kept so a crashed run can be resumed.
#   results.tsv journal at benchmark/ root, one row per experiment.
benchmark/**/__pycache__/
benchmark/telemetry/
benchmark/reports/
benchmark/logs/
benchmark/results.tsv
benchmark/runs/
# Ancien layout, conservé pour rétrocompat.
benchmark/corpus/
# Nouveau layout : chacun amène ses propres samples, jamais sur Git
# (audio privé, transcriptions Whisper de l'utilisateur).
benchmark/corpora/
benchmark/external/
benchmark/models-cache/
# Artefacts d'anciennes itérations, conservés en local comme matière
# première mais jamais publiés.
benchmark/_archive/
benchmark/config/voxtral_paths.toml
# Relais transitoire entre sessions Claude, pas de la doctrine pérenne.
benchmark/HANDOFF.md

